              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eAdd or edit a one-day exception to a shift schedule.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003ePick what it is for\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eChoose the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eEquipment\u003c/span\u003e, \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eShift\u003c/span\u003e, and \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDate\u003c/span\u003e \u0026ndash; once saved, these three cannot change. Moving an override means removing it and adding a new one.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eSet the times\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eEnter \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eStart\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eEnd\u003c/span\u003e as 24-hour \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eHH:MM\u003c/span\u003e \u0026ndash; picking the shift fills these in first, so only change them if this day is actually different.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eAn overnight shift is fine \u0026ndash; End earlier than Start just means it crosses midnight. Start and End only need to differ from each other.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eSave\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eSave\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eRemove\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRemove\u003c/span\u003e. The record is kept so past OEE figures can still be explained \u0026ndash; it is hidden, not erased.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
